    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n2808" root="بطن" body-key="b">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَطَنٌ</span></b>  <i>Disease of the belly,</i> (K, TA,) <i>being a
state of enlargement thereof arising from satiety;</i>
and so ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَطْنٌ</span></b> ; whence the phrase <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَاتَ بِالبَطْنِ</span> <i>He
died by the disease of the belly.</i> (TA.)

